  paragraphs:
  - 'AURORA: Captain, I was wondering...'
  - 'COSMO: Hmm, what is it, Aurora?'
  - 'AURORA: Do you ever wonder if there are other planets out there like our own? '
  - "COSMO: Habitable? We\u2019ve already corporatised Mars, you want to go even
    further than that?!"
  - "AURORA: No Cos I mean... friendly? They have some sort of intelligent life.
    I\u2019m sure they\u2019re not all the murdering kind?"
  - "COSMO: Doubt it. All \u201Calien species\u201D we\u2019ve had to deal with so
    far have been nothing but trouble. Don\u2019t go having second thoughts, this
    \u201CSpecimen X\u201D is no different. "
  - "AURORA: You\u2019re right Cos, just wishful thinking I suppose."
